<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Tuesday — AI agents renew a merchant's subscriptions through PayPal</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/ag-grid-community@31.3.4/styles/ag-grid.css" crossorigin="anonymous">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/ag-grid-community@31.3.4/styles/ag-theme-quartz.css" crossorigin="anonymous">
